@*
    The headings of the measures of a track record, in the order that TrackRecordCells writes
    them in (FR-EXP-2). A table of records has them after the heading of what each row is of.
*@

<th scope="col">Closed trades</th>
<th scope="col">Win rate</th>
<th scope="col">Average R</th>
<th scope="col">Total R</th>
<th scope="col">Profit factor</th>
<th scope="col">Largest drawdown</th>
<th scope="col">Average holding time</th>
<th scope="col">Notes</th>
